    "title": "Ebay Expands Circular Fashion Fund Across Europe and North America - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Maliha Shoaib ,\n14 hours ago Ebay is opening up its Circular Fashion Fund to applicants from the EU, Switzerland and Canada for the first time in 2026, adding to its established presence in the UK, the US, Germany and Australia. The annual program, which launched in 2022, aims to support businesses tackling fashion’s environmental footprint,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
